<http://data.silknow.org/object/81f4c736-430c-3c55-8c72-60d0f4c0aceb/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Hanging, part, linen embroidered with silk in surface darning on the diagonal over 3 threads.  double running in a line and running stitch (border).  \nThe ground is covered with undulating parallel stems which are blue and which contain a broken pattern of stems and flowers in reserve, and which is edged with yellow serrations.  Large red tulips edged with green serrated leaves are attached by a short red stem and these alternate with smaller red leaves, edged with green and a pair of white leaves."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/81f4c736-430c-3c55-8c72-60d0f4c0aceb> .

